WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:06.520
Westworld Season 2 is full of flashbacks and
time-twists that make it hard to tell what’s

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.520
happening.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.809
Let’s figure out the timeline, from the
beginning.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:15.570
Bout thirty-five years ago, Ford and Arnold
created Westworld and the hosts.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.520
They got investment from Logan, the son of
James Delos.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.790
After Arnold’s son Charlie died, Arnold
worked with the host Dolores to bring her

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.590
to consciousness, which is symbolised by the
Maze.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.030
But Arnold realised that conscious hosts would
suffer in the Westworld park.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:36.550
So he tried to stop the park opening by making
Dolores kill the hosts and himself.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:41.050
The host Akecheta found Arnold’s maze in
the aftermath, which started his own path

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.489
to consciousness.

00:00:42.489 --> 00:00:47.570
At some point, Ford and Dolores created Bernard,
a host based on Arnold.

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:51.170
Despite Arnold’s death, Ford opened the
park anyway.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.670
A few years later, Logan brings William to
the park.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:59.290
William falls in love with Dolores, but then
turns to violence and darkness, becoming the

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.710
Man in Black.

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:05.470
William leaves Logan in the desert, and he
and James invest more in Westworld.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.310
William builds the Forge in the Valley Beyond.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:13.750
This place records data on Westworld guests,
so they can decode the human mind and make

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:19.040
immortal copies of people . William marries
James’ daughter Juliet and takes over the

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:20.170
Delos company.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:24.380
Logan falls out with his father James, and
later dies of an overdose.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.010
When James dies, they make an immortal copy
of him, though in a physical body he keeps

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:30.500
breaking down.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.910
So all of this happens in the past.

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:36.720
Thirty years later, Season 1 happens.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:41.920
After Juliet commits suicide, William visits
the Delos clone one last time, then enters

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:46.350
the park and kills Maeve, and becomes obsessed
with the Maze.

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.100
But the Maze is about host consciousness.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:52.320
So Dolores awakes by remembering her past.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.120
Maeve awakes, and decides to find her host
daughter.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:59.619
Westworld executives Theresa and Charlotte
try to take power from Ford.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:03.510
Charlotte puts a key to the Forge inside the
host Peter Abernathy.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:07.810
And in the Season 1 finale, Dolores starts
a robot uprising.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:13.520
She kills Ford – but Ford knew this would
happen, and has Bernard make a digital backup

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.520
of Ford.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:16.570
That’s Season 1.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.000
Season 2 has two timelines.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.510
Most of the season happens before the Valley
floods.

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:27.760
But there’s also the stuff after the flood
– with Bernard on the beach, and Karl Strand.

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:30.150
The rest is straightforward.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.910
So Dolores fights her war on humans and hosts.

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:37.569
William faces his past, and ends up killing
his daughter Emily.

00:02:37.569 --> 00:02:43.240
Akecheta leads hosts to the Door to the Sublime
– a digital paradise for hosts.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:48.170
Maeve goes to Shogunworld, and gets her daughter
into the Sublime before Maeve is killed.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:52.690
Bernard gets caught up with Charlotte looking
for Abernathy , then he and Elsie find James

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:56.580
Delos, and the copy of Ford gets in Bernard’s
head for a bit.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:00.010
Dolores attacks the Mesa and gets the Abernathy
key.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:05.099
She goes to the Forge with Bernard and uses
its data to learn about the human mind.

00:03:05.099 --> 00:03:09.989
Dolores starts the big flood and tries to
destroy the Forge and the Sublime , so Bernard

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:15.500
kills her . But then Bernard helps Dolores
by putting her mind inside a copied body of

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.500
Charlotte.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.370
Bernard scrambles his own memories to hide
the truth , lies on the beach –

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.860
and wakes up in Episode 1.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:28.209
Strand looks for Abernathy with Charlotte
who by then is actually Dolores.

00:03:28.209 --> 00:03:32.450
So when Charlotte finds that Bernard’s a
host, and tortures him – that Charlotte

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:35.230
is Dolores – call her Charlores.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:40.060
The humans drain the Valley and return to
the Forge, where Charlores kills Strand.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:45.420
She decides to help the hosts in the Sublime
by satellite transferring them somewhere safe.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:50.540
Then Dolores kills Bernard, and takes his
brain and others out of Westworld.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:55.480
In Arnold’s old house, Dolores recreates
her own body, and Bernard’s, and plans to

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.570
take over the re world.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:03.861
Back in the park, William is still alive –
But in some far future timeline , we a copy

00:04:03.861 --> 00:04:10.890
of Bill go down an elevator into the old ruined
Forge, and meet a host version of Emily.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:16.160
This William is trapped in a loop – a prison
of his own sins.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.379
So that’s what happens in Westworld, but
what does it mean?

00:04:19.379 --> 00:04:22.800
We’ll answer that in a new video coming
soon.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:29.009
